# Steelbore Standard §6.5 — Text File Format.
#
# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and on checkout,
# regardless of the contributor's core.autocrlf setting. This repository is
# a Texinfo publication with no Windows-native scripts, so there is no
# pinned CRLF exception; if one is ever needed it is written here as its own
# line (e.g. `*.bat text eol=crlf`), never left implicit.
* text=auto eol=lf
